[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0900","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0900.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0348","title":"SCO UnixWare sendmail.cf 权限提升漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.1.0 及更早版本中默认安装的 Sendmail 配置文件 sendmail.cf 存在权限配置缺陷，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞提升至 root 权限。攻击者通过构造特制的配置文件或利用 Sendmail 运行时的特权操作，可完全控制系统，造成机密性、完整性和可用性全部丧失。CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0348"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:31Z","remediation":"立即从 SCO 官方 FTP 获取安全公告 SB-99.10a 中提供的补丁，更新 sendmail.cf 配置文件以修复权限配置缺陷。具体操作：下载补丁后执行 `scoadmin` 应用补丁包，或手动替换 `/etc/mail/sendmail.cf` 为加固版本并重启 sendmail 服务（`/etc/init.d/mail stop/start`）。由于 SCO UnixWare 7.1.0 及更早版本已停止官方支持，建议尽快迁移至受支持的 Unix/Linux 发行版以获取持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0348.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0348","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0348.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0348.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-62pv-x977-5p4f/GHSA-62pv-x977-5p4f.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88295/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0348.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/48d9bee10ba6f9c95b14d9de429f21fee40e28eb/2000.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0900.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0808","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0808.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0308","title":"SCO UnixWare Netscape 服务器权限提升漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.0.x 及 2.1.3 系统中 Netscape FastTrack Server 2.x、Enterprise Server 2.0 和 Proxy Server 2.5 的安装文件权限设置不当，导致本地攻击者可通过访问权限过高的敏感文件或目录获取 root 权限。该漏洞源于软件安装过程中未正确限制文件访问权限，攻击者无需认证即可利用此缺陷实现权限提升，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议升级至修复版本或手动修正文件权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0308"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:26Z","remediation":"升级至 Netscape FastTrack Server 3.0 及以上版本。对无法升级的系统，立即修复文件权限：以 root 执行 `chmod 755 /opt/netsuite/suitespot/bin` 及 `chmod 644 /opt/netsuite/suitespot/*.conf`，移除不必要的 setuid 二进制文件，并将敏感目录属主改为 `nobody`。在 /etc/inetd.conf 中禁用不必要的 Netscape 服务端口作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0308.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0308","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0308.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0308.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-qwxm-r9mr-vq2h/GHSA-qwxm-r9mr-vq2h.json","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/7db1c0aca641164bcc9422b571eb34ddf2f0494c/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0308.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3ba2bd6a-56d3-4758-a3b9-f10406d45458.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0808.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0392","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0392.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0375","title":"FreeBSD kernel 符号链接跟随本地任意文件修改漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 3.2 内核在生成进程崩溃转储（core dump）文件时未正确处理符号链接，未正确检查目标文件路径是否为符号链接，导致本地攻击者可通过在受影响目录中预先创建符号链接，诱使内核将 core dump 数据写入任意文件，从而实现任意文件内容覆盖或篡改。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 3.2 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，可导致系统文件完整性破坏或权限提升。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0375"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:35Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 至 3.3 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 FreeBSD-SA-00:17 安全公告中修复。如无法升级，可通过在 /etc/sysctl.conf 中添加 kern.coredump=0 禁用 core dump 功能，或使用 chmod 1777 设置 core dump 目录权限防止符号链接攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6084","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0375.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0375","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0375.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0375.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9608541b971a314a928294c8f88371b45ef3f307/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wqf6-fx9r-6p5h/GHSA-wqf6-fx9r-6p5h.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0375.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f352dfaf39e3e89c1c3ab384d9e74e4219126910/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--0a4092b0-9a32-44f2-96f2-70daf0d86af8.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0392.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0383","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0383.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0368","title":"Cisco IOS 命令历史记录敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 9.1及之后版本存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。具有登录提示符访问权限的攻击者可通过查看历史命令记录获取先前用户输入的命令片段，从而窃取可能包含密码、配置信息等敏感数据。该漏洞源于系统未正确清除命令历史缓冲区，攻击条件为需要本地访问权限，利用难度较低，可导致部分机密性损失。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0368"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:34Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 12.0 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可在全局配置模式下使用 `no service password-recovery` 命令禁用密码恢复功能，并限制物理控制台访问权限，仅允许授权管理员通过 SSH 登录，同时配置 `exec-timeout` 自动注销空闲会话以防止历史命令泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/j-009.shtml","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/770/ioshist-pub.shtml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0368.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0368.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0368","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0368.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0368.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/74884340187670a91b9d5bdb799b52e73426ad63/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fxrh-cvvm-q99f/GHSA-fxrh-cvvm-q99f.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88326/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0368.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0383.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0360","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0360.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0351","title":"SCO UnixWare 软件包管理命令权限提升漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.1.0 系统中的软件包管理命令存在不安全的权限配置漏洞，本地攻击者利用该漏洞可绕过权限限制添加或删除系统软件包，影响系统的完整性和可用性。攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，无需特殊条件即可利用，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0351"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:32Z","remediation":"立即应用 SCO 官方安全公告 SB-99.09b 中提供的补丁，升级受影响软件包至修复版本。如无法立即打补丁，可移除受影响打包命令（如 pkgadd、pkgrm 等）的 setuid/setgid 权限位，并严格限制本地用户仅授权可信管理员登录系统，以降低本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0351.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/C