stV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0349.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0349","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0349.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0349.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-9x84-pg52-6jhq/GHSA-9x84-pg52-6jhq.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0349.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88303/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/48d9bee10ba6f9c95b14d9de429f21fee40e28eb/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--fd5163ad-209e-42a8-a9f3-22d9a212ed74.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0357.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0314","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0314.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0315","title":"NetBSD traceroute 本地源地址伪造漏洞","description":"NetBSD 1.3.3 及部分 Linux 系统中的 traceroute 工具存在源地址伪造漏洞。本地低权限用户可修改 traceroute 所发送数据包的源 IP 地址，从而发起 IP 欺骗攻击。攻击者利用此漏洞可伪造数据包来源，绕过基于 IP 的访问控制或隐藏攻击来源。该漏洞需要本地系统访问权限，攻击条件受限，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0315"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:27Z","remediation":"升级 NetBSD 至 1.4 及以上版本，或应用 NetBSD-SA1999-004 提供的 traceroute 补丁修复 waittime 参数未作边界检查导致 select(2) 立即返回的缺陷。临时缓解措施可执行 `chmod u-s /usr/sbin/traceroute` 移除 suid 位，仅允许 root 用户运行 traceroute。Linux 系统应更新 traceroute 至支持源地址合法性校验的版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91893782027835&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/7575","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0315.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0315","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0315.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0315.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-jf7m-pxqr-jvc5/GHSA-jf7m-pxqr-jvc5.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_400_500.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88342/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0315.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-269.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0314.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0314.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0313","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0313.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0314","title":"NetBSD 和 Linux traceroute 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetBSD 1.3.3 及部分 Linux 系统中 traceroute 工具存在参数解析缺陷，本地用户可通过向 -w（waittime）选项传入超长数值，导致程序内部解析异常并将数据包发送延迟置为零。攻击者可利用该漏洞以极快速度向目标系统发送大量数据包，造成网络拥塞或拒绝服务。该漏洞需要本地用户权限才能触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0314"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:27Z","remediation":"NetBSD 用户应立即应用 19990217-traceroute 补丁（可从 ftp.NetBSD.ORG 获取），或升级至 NetBSD 1.3.3 以上版本。临时缓解措施：执行 `chmod u-s /usr/sbin/traceroute` 移除 traceroute 的 setuid 位，限制仅 root 用户可运行。Linux 用户应升级 traceroute 至 1.4a7 以上版本，或通过包管理器安装更新（如 `apt-get update && apt-get upgrade traceroute`）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91893782027835&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/7574","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0314.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0314","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0314.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0314.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-c4h3-4hjj-m5cr/GHSA-c4h3-4hjj-m5cr.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88343/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0314.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ae4bac31-af94-4f46-9c2a-778b17bc2995.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--ae4bac31-af94-4f46-9c2a-778b17bc2995.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0313.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0307","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0307.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0313","title":"OpenBSD 网络接口媒体配置本地提权漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 2.6 系统中存在本地权限配置漏洞，具有系统访问权限的本地用户可通过修改网络接口媒体配置参数，导致系统网络功能异常或降级。该漏洞源于系统对接口配置操作缺少充分的权限校验，攻击者需拥有本地 shell 访问权限才能利用。受影响版本为 OpenBSD 2.6，危害等级中危，建议升级至高版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0313"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:27Z","remediation":"该漏洞存在于 OpenBSD 2.6，任何本地用户均可通过 ifmedia ioctl 修改网络接口介质配置。建议立即从 OpenBSD 官方 errata 页面下载并应用编号 002 的源码补丁，或升级至 OpenBSD 2.7 及以上版本。若无法升级，可限制本地用户登录或禁用受影响接口的 ifmedia 功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openbsd.org/errata.html#ifmedia","http://www.osvdb.org/7540","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0313.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0313","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0313.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0313.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-84m3-hwqx-qqwm/GHSA-84m3-hwqx-qqwm.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0313.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--23b012c2-b67b-4bcc-9726-63a0784bfb73.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f3526cd689b486e2ddce9b934197355bd7bbd3ae/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--23b012c2-b67b-4bcc-9726-63a0784bfb73.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0307.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0303","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0303.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0312","title":"OpenBSD cron 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 2.5 系统的 cron（时钟守护进程）在处理 argv[] 参数时存在空终止符缺失漏洞，导致函数指针数组未被正确终止，传递给 cron 的伪 popen 函数后可被利用。本地攻击者可通过构造特制的命令行参数触发此内存处理缺陷，成功利用可实现权限提升，获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 2.5 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议升级至不受影响的版本或应用补丁修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0312"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:27Z","remediation":"升级 OpenBSD 至 2.6 及以上版本，其中已修复 cron 进程的 argv 空终止检查。若无法升级，可限制本地用户对 cron 作业的写入权限，并移除 crontab 的 setuid 位作为临时缓解措施。编译时启用栈保护选项也可增加利用难度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openbsd.org/errata25.html#cron","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0312.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0312","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0312.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0312.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-835h-phw4-qgfr/GHSA-835h-phw4-qgfr.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_0_100.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88301/info.html","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-170.txt","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d9e690522c86144671671f4250daa9ba0347e09/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-03xx/CVE-2000-0312.json","https://github.com/ragiko/ntcir11/blob/e5b134c4e6784918dbfdc8a01d2c276d1847b032/workspace/gensim_sentence2vec/extract/36646.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0303.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0303.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0301","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0301.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0310","title":"OpenBSD 2.4 IP分片重组拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 2.4 内核 IP 分片重组模块存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送大量精心构造的 IP 分片数据包，触发分片重组缓冲区过度消耗，导致系统资源枯竭并引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 2.4 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0310"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:26Z","remediation":"立即升级至 OpenBSD 2.5 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本修复。如无法升级，请依次应用 OpenBSD 2.4 errata 补丁：先安装 #006（ipq 竞态条件修复）和 #010（TCP 解码修复），再安装 #008（IP 分片重组修复），补丁可从 openbsd.org/errata24.html 获取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openbsd.org/errata24.html#maxqueue","http://www.osvdb.org/7539","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0310.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0310","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0310.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0310.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mx9m-hpp3-577c/GHSA-mx9m-hpp3-577c.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88302/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0310.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--658a1d9e-1953-4321-84a4-211412643893.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0301.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0298","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0298.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0309","title":"OpenBSD 2.4 DDB 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 2.4 系统在启用 DDB（内核调试器）的情况下，其 i386 架构的 trace-trap 处理机制存在安全缺陷。本地攻击者可通过触发特定的追踪陷阱（trace-trap）导致系统内核崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 2.4 版本，需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，无法远程利用，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0309"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:26Z","remediation":"升级至 OpenBSD 2.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 i386 跟踪陷阱处理中的拒绝服务漏洞。如无法升级，在编译内核时移除 DDB 选项（`option DDB`），禁用内核调试器以消除攻击面。限制本地用户对系统的交互式访问权限亦可作为临时缓解措施。","status"