,"severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0307"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:26Z","remediation":"升级至 SCO OpenServer 5.0.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复 xserver 对保留端口（1024 以下）的访问控制缺陷。无法升级时，可通过限制本地用户对 X 服务器的访问权限或禁用 xserver 的 setuid 位作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0307.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0307","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0307.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0307.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-ffrr-675f-6pxv/GHSA-ffrr-675f-6pxv.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88291/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0307.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--53416e9c-1682-4fa9-b69f-2cb50fd99cfe.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/a3d797a054f33a26fc99648a4e1cc47b2bce8d08/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0297.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0264","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0264.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0306","title":"SCO OpenServer calserver 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SCO OpenServer 系统中的 calserver 组件存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的超长消息，触发 calserver 中的缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 SCO OpenServer 及 SCO UNIX 5 系列版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前厂商已发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0306"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:26Z","remediation":"立即从 ftp://ftp.sco.com/SSE/security_bulletins/SB-99.02a 获取并安装 SCO OpenServer 安全补丁 SB-99.02a。如无法安装补丁，可在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释掉 calserver 服务行并重启 inetd 以禁用该服务，同时在防火墙层面限制对 457/TCP 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=1998-12-29&msg=AAh6GYsGU1%40leshka.chuvashia.su","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20620","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0306.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0306","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0306.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0306.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/309.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-rx9m-8fvp-xhpf/GHSA-rx9m-8fvp-xhpf.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/exploit.rules","https://github.com/bailehang/snort_2.2.0/blob/34f8a3a85f15645aea53d6e0d46863c7c57e43ef/doc/signatures/304.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0306.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0264.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0997","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0997.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0893","title":"SGI IRIX Distributed GL Daemon 信息泄露漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 系统中 Distributed GL Daemon（dgld）服务默认监听在 5232 端口，该服务未对远程访问请求进行有效身份验证或访问控制。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的 5232 端口发送探测请求，利用该服务响应特征识别目标主机为 SGI IRIX 系统，导致系统信息泄露。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 多个版本，攻击者无需任何认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议禁用不必要的 dgld 服务或通过防火墙限制对 5232 端口的访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0893"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:41Z","remediation":"建议立即禁用 IRIX 系统上不需要的 dgld 服务：以 root 身份执行 `/etc/init.d/dgld stop` 停止服务，并编辑 `/etc/inetd.conf` 注释掉 dgld 相关行后重启 inetd。如业务需要保留该服务，应在网络边界防火墙封禁 TCP/UDP 5232 端口的入站流量，防止外部攻击者通过扫描该端口识别 IRIX 系统并针对其他已知漏洞（如 ObjectServer VU#16642、df VU#20851）发起后续攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/28027","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0893.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0893.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0893","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0893.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0893.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0893.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/da1453d4cae0dea874922584911158e4da10a575/2000/CVE-2000-0893.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7